        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Fossil fuels, such as coal, oil and natural gas, are the main sources for many countries. However, some nations are using alternative energy such as solar power and wind power. Do you think this is a positive or negative development?​",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQTHd5zLroPWEBxKNq4lMbUdgYd\"><em><strong>Fossil fuels, such as coal, oil and natural gas, are the main sources for many countries. However, some nations are using alternative energy such as solar power and wind power. Do you think this is a positive or negative development?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Transition from Fossil Fuels to Renewable Energy <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3rMdv4zAo1jGpxg5FYlWXGFggb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Transition from Fossil Fuels to Renewable Energy cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Nhi&ecirc;n liệu h&oacute;a thạch như than đ&aacute;, dầu mỏ v&agrave; kh&iacute; đốt tự nhi&ecirc;n l&agrave; nguồn năng lượng ch&iacute;nh cho nhiều quốc gia. Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, một số quốc gia đang sử dụng năng lượng thay thế như năng lượng mặt trời v&agrave; năng lượng gi&oacute;.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0QrdAMv7oilThxPJ5wlCi6mgHp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL7id1P5PoeP9GxtckAlXjQLgKc\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Transition from Fossil Fuels to Renewable Energy v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAB3dnRwhoeC1Wx60mOlZ5Zkgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFFwdCaMRo6xOJxKGselA3gxgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JDdydaFWOoBhJ0x8V5rlxBR8ghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">primary energy sources (nguồn năng lượng ch&iacute;nh)</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JDdydaFWOoBhJ0x8V5rlxBR8ghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">alternative energy (năng lượng thay thế)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>'đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng ph&aacute;t triển t&iacute;ch cực mặc d&ugrave; c&oacute; một số th&aacute;ch thức'. </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8nVd6ui7oPyVMxWilEloA8Sgfb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số bất lợi/th&aacute;ch thức của việc chuyển sang năng lượng thay thế.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UeCkdNayooZiasxvZUwlLX1Ag6e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những lợi &iacute;ch vượt trội hơn nhiều m&agrave; năng lượng thay thế mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số bất lợi/th&aacute;ch thức của việc chuyển sang năng lượng thay thế.</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, sự chuyển đổi sang c&aacute;c nguồn năng lượng t&aacute;i tạo đi k&egrave;m với một số bất lợi.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D85ydGvYPopsOexdQSzlI7Yvggf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BkBXdDtcooR4lqxVdqTl04DTg3e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Một mối lo ngại l&agrave; <em>sự phụ thuộc v&agrave;o thời tiết (weather dependency)</em> v&agrave; <em>t&iacute;nh kh&ocirc;ng ổn định (unreliability)</em> của c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng nghệ n&agrave;y, v&igrave; c&aacute;c <em>tấm pin mặt trời (solar panels)</em> cần &aacute;nh s&aacute;ng mặt trời v&agrave; <em>tuabin gi&oacute; (wind turbines)</em> cần gi&oacute; để tạo ra điện.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SMONdXgL7oahZdxmKklljZSzgyf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; nghĩa l&agrave; ch&uacute;ng kh&ocirc;ng thể đảm bảo <em>nguồn cung cấp điện ổn định (consistent power supply)</em>, c&oacute; thể dẫn đến <em>t&igrave;nh trạng thiếu điện (power shortages)</em> trong những giai đoạn c&oacute; <em>điều kiện thời tiết kh&ocirc;ng thuận lợi (unfavourable weather conditions</em>), chẳng hạn như những ng&agrave;y nhiều m&acirc;y hoặc gi&oacute; lặng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUm7dcHfLo20hgxySC7lpBHxgjd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QTerdTD1hoUGW0xyA5FlzI0qgHf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Ngo&agrave;i ra, <em>nhiều nước đang ph&aacute;t triển (developing countries)</em> phải đối mặt với những trở ngại đ&aacute;ng kể do <em>c&ocirc;ng nghệ hạn chế (limited technology)</em> trong lĩnh vực n&agrave;y.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UD28dt0yGouDLExLLCOlmzSlgDh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason:</strong> Những quốc gia n&agrave;y thường thiếu <em>nguồn t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh (financial resources)</em> v&agrave; <em>chuy&ecirc;n m&ocirc;n kỹ thuật (technical expertise)</em> cần thiết để ph&aacute;t triển c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng nghệ n&agrave;y trong nước, buộc họ phải phụ thuộc v&agrave;o việc nhập khẩu đắt tiền từ c&aacute;c nước ph&aacute;t triển hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những lợi &iacute;ch vượt trội hơn nhiều m&agrave; năng lượng thay thế mang lại.</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin chắc rằng những lợi &iacute;ch của việc &aacute;p dụng năng lượng thay thế (alternative energy) quan trọng hơn nhiều.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LeX1d74K2oszJwxVwgLlOlubghg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkeldoaoMokRxRxYECWljT3dg3g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: kh&ocirc;ng giống như <em>nhi&ecirc;n liệu h&oacute;a thạch (fossil fuels)</em> vốn c&oacute; hạn v&agrave; cuối c&ugrave;ng sẽ cạn kiệt, năng lượng mặt trời v&agrave; gi&oacute; l&agrave; <em>c&aacute;c nguồn năng lượng t&aacute;i tạo v&agrave; bền vững (renewable and sustainable energy sources)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V0VjdHScloZpHixcULslcAmcgdc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact</strong>: Điều n&agrave;y đảm bảo an ninh năng lượng d&agrave;i hạn (long-term energy security) cho c&aacute;c quốc gia v&agrave; bảo đảm nguồn cung cấp điện ổn định (stable power supply) cho c&aacute;c thế hệ tương lai m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng lo sợ cạn kiệt t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OF6RdYATso7Jyzxkud3lxrSRgLc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx3Ud3ZRuojDvLxy5F2lhSbjgaf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Hơn nữa,<em> lợi &iacute;ch m&ocirc;i trường (environmental benefits) </em>của qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh chuyển đổi n&agrave;y kh&ocirc;ng thể bị đ&aacute;nh gi&aacute; thấp.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TCtCdUbRzotNVbxyv1blviIsgbg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:</strong> Năng lượng thay thế kh&ocirc;ng tạo ra <em>kh&iacute; thải carbon (carbon emissions)</em>, dẫn đến <em>giảm &ocirc; nhiễm kh&ocirc;ng kh&iacute; (reduced air pollution)</em> ở c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phố lớn, từ đ&oacute; l&agrave;m giảm <em>c&aacute;c bệnh về h&ocirc; hấp (respiratory diseases)</em> trong cư d&acirc;n đ&ocirc; thị. Hơn nữa, sự chuyển đổi n&agrave;y gi&uacute;p bảo vệ <em>c&aacute;c nguồn nước sạch hơn (cleaner water sources)</em> v&igrave; c&oacute; &iacute;t &ocirc; nhiễm c&ocirc;ng nghiệp hơn từ việc đốt nhi&ecirc;n liệu h&oacute;a thạch, cuối c&ugrave;ng g&oacute;p phần v&agrave;o cuộc chiến chống <em>biến đổi kh&iacute; hậu (climate change)</em> v&agrave; <em>n&oacute;ng l&ecirc;n to&agrave;n cầu (global warming)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2ludgo4OokMAXxI7XBlboYqgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NZJ5diZ6OoQkltxv3m6lz9I7g5b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">reliability issues and technological limitations <em>(vấn đề về độ tin cậy v&agrave; hạn chế c&ocirc;ng nghệ)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NZJ5diZ6OoQkltxv3m6lz9I7g5b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">sustainability <em>(t&iacute;nh bền vững)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2920,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>While fossil fuels such as coal, oil and natural gas continue to be the primary energy sources for many nations, an increasing number of countries are now turning to alternative energy like solar power and wind power. Although this transition presents certain challenges, I believe it is a positive development overall.</p>",
            "question_id": 37263,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2921,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>Admittedly, the shift towards renewable energy sources comes with some disadvantages. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">One concern is the weather dependency and unreliability of these technologies, as solar panels require sunlight and wind turbines need wind to generate electricity. This means they cannot guarantee a consistent power supply, which may lead to power shortages during periods of unfavourable weather conditions, such as cloudy days or calm winds.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, many developing countries face significant obstacles due to limited technology in this field. These nations often lack the financial resources and technical expertise needed to develop these technologies domestically, forcing them to rely on expensive imports from more advanced countries.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 37263,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2922,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>However, I am convinced that the benefits of adopting alternative energy are far more significant.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Firstly, unlike fossil fuels, which are finite and will eventually be depleted, solar and wind energy are renewable and sustainable energy sources. This ensures long-term energy security for nations and guarantees a stable power supply for future generations without the fear of running out of resources.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, the environmental benefits of this transition cannot be overstated. Alternative energy produces no carbon emissions, leading to reduced air pollution in major cities, which in turn results in fewer respiratory diseases among urban populations. Moreover, this shift helps preserve cleaner water sources as there is less industrial pollution from burning fossil fuels, ultimately contributing to the fight against climate change and global warming.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 37263,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
